{"complete_extracted_copy":false,"coverage":"centralized-copy","entries":{"war-card-game.copy.description":{"context":"war-card-game UI copy.description","source_hash":"5243707b749de466d207cfdc52a8ce42cd048a299c98c19e8404887d4b3a7bdf","translation":"Kucheza classic War kadi mchezo ndani na wachezaji wawili hadi wanne. kadi Flip, kutatua mahusiano na uso-chini na uso-up kadi, na kuweka kila kadi juu ya kifaa hiki."},"war-card-game.copy.details":{"context":"war-card-game UI copy.details","source_hash":"2715af10c4a5bb36bfddde1138cc5fde0aab30bbd6e0eb9ef604b4db811fd5af","translation":"Hii toleo inafuata Norway Krig kanuni kuchunguza dhidi ya Norske kortspill. Wachezaji wawili hadi wanne kushiriki moja kiwango 52-card deck bila jokeri. Kadi ni kushughulikiwa uso chini kama sawa kama inawezekana; na wachezaji watatu, kadi moja ni kuweka kando isiyoonekana. Kila mtu flips kadi ya juu pamoja. Rangi ya juu inashinda kadi zote juu ya meza; suits si jambo. Ace ni ya juu na 2 ni ya chini. Kama kadi ya juu ya sare, kila mchezaji ambaye alijiunga kwamba vita nafasi moja kadi uso chini na kisha moja uso juu. juu mpya face-up kadi inachukua stack nzima. stack zaidi inarudi hatua hiyo hiyo. mchezaji ambaye hawezi kutoa wote vita kadi kupoteza; kadi zao zilizobaki kujiunga stack vita. mchezaji wa mwisho na kadi anashinda. mchezo ni bahati-kuendesha, inaweza kuchukua muda mrefu, na toleo hili si madai ya kuzuia kila mfululizo inawezekana kurudia."},"war-card-game.copy.exampleHeading":{"context":"war-card-game UI copy.exampleHeading","source_hash":"c5872244109aaa97b376f35e70452f8bc4f5cdf67606bbabaeefffb1bb356c46","translation":"mfano wa haraka"},"war-card-game.copy.faq.0.q":{"context":"war-card-game UI copy.faq.0.q","source_hash":"8788e11e58a20d4339822c60f9156e759298d13734ef9e31f7d290b570360536","translation":"Wachezaji wangapi wanaweza kucheza?"},"war-card-game.copy.faqHeading":{"context":"war-card-game UI copy.faqHeading","source_hash":"e956a9404b467e6b372e082d28cb9d4710af764c2fa5e56a